# Environment Variables for Personal Site

# Google Analytics Tracking ID (optional)
# Get this from Google Analytics dashboard
# VITE_GA_TRACKING_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Note: In Vite, all environment variables must be prefixed with VITE_
# to be exposed to the client-side code.

# API Base URL is configured in src/constants/api.js
# If you need to change it, update that file instead of using env vars.
